// Shared TRAQS logo assets — generated from the v4.0 iOS wordmark
// (Assets.xcassets/TRAQSLogo*.imageset, traqs-wordmark-bold-*), so the web
// wordmark is the same artwork the iOS app renders. v4.0 is the heavier lettering;
// the previous generation came from the older, lighter 2400x1200 art.
//
// Cropped to the true ink bounds plus a 3% margin so nothing touches an edge —
// the "q" descender in particular needs the room, and an earlier crop clipped its
// tail off entirely.
//
// Aspect ratio is 810:304 (2.664); the Fast TRAQS mask in TRAQS.jsx hard-codes
// this ratio, so update it there if these are regenerated. It changed from 2.755
// with v4.0, because the new lettering is proportionally taller.
//
// The "WHITE" variant is the cream wordmark intended for dark surfaces, the "BLUE"
// variant is the black wordmark intended for light surfaces. UL_LOGO_WHITE is the
// rendering target throughout the app (header, login, Fast TRAQS) and is theme-flipped
// via CSS filter: brightness(0) on light themes.
export const TRAQS_LOGO_BLUE  = "data:image/png;base64,";
export const TRAQS_LOGO_WHITE = "data:image/png;base64,";
export const UL_LOGO_WHITE    = "data:image/png;base64,";
